      "finding_id": "CPRI-CONSUMER-FINDING-001",
      "issue": "C12 normalized invariant/type.invariant scaffold and C53 outer Definition/v1 carrier have different classification axes;no direct current contract binds CPRI meaning. A scaffold is not a canonical artifact instance or accepted representation map.",
      "status": "unresolved"
    },
    {
      "accepted_map_refs": [],
      "finding_id": "CPRI-CONSUMER-FINDING-002",
      "issue": "Linked canonical-kind table is candidate,uncited and not closed,with six unresolved producers;D51 requires current owner-approved allowed origins and rejects unresolved/candidate producers. Candidate table prose is not an admitted allowed-origin source;exact process/version/producer and owner source correspondence remain pending.",
      "status": "unresolved"
    },
    {
      "accepted_map_refs": [],
      "finding_id": "CPRI-CONSUMER-FINDING-003",
      "issue": "CPRI and Artifact inherit kind-derived durability;Lifetime allows an owner-noted effective instance override. Fine/coarse granularity permits differing defaults but does not settle the effective override. Prior LIFE-CONSUMER-FINDING-001 remains unresolved;default/effective fields and owner precedence require an accepted map.",
      "status": "unresolved"
    },
    {
      "accepted_map_refs": [],
      "finding_id": "CPRI-CONSUMER-FINDING-004",
      "issue": "Definition schema and pure projection accept textual duplicate-machine,current unsupported L2,execution/truth/authority and candidate-producer claims. Closed Definition schema rejects instance origin/representation/receipt fields. Shape and regeneration do not enforce or accept this artifact-instance theory.",
      "status": "unresolved"
    },
    {
      "accepted_map_refs": [],
      "finding_id": "CPRI-CONSUMER-FINDING-005",
      "issue": "Declared,L1 integrity-bound and conditional future L2 support have no accepted source-to-receipt/statement/state/actor/policy/signature map in this review. A hypothetical linked future witness does not make actor attestation currently available or prove execution,truth,correctness or authority.",
      "status": "unresolved"
    },
    {
      "accepted_map_refs": [],
      "finding_id": "CPRI-CONSUMER-FINDING-006",
      "issue": "Candidate four-kind frontmatter assigns kind via filename or named session-path rule;CPRI prohibits directory placement establishing semantic type or authority. Distinguish a separately governed carrier-selection rule from unguided directory inference;scope,kind inclusion,authority independence and C53 overlay/body correspondence remain owner pending.",
      "status": "unresolved"
    }
